  "description": "‘Will a happy life come after the corona virus is over?’  \nA tsunami that ran 10km over the past year to get to school to save even transportation costs in order to overcome the disaster.  \nThe run that I bought and struggled with will shine in the 2023 Corona End Commemoration Marathon, and spread hope.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=784818), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6370211)",
